{"turn_id": "d22-t1", "session_id": "d22", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "automatic_generation_method", "text": "论文提出了一种方法，从公共数据源自动生成用于命名实体识别（NER）的带标签数据集，利用DBpedia和Wikipedia中的链接与结构化数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"}]}, {"key": "no_human_supervision", "text": "该工作构建数据集时没有人工监督，通过利用按语义网原则组织的公共数据源（DBpedia和Wikipedia）来构建带标签的数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}]}, {"key": "fully_automatic_no_human_labor", "text": "结论部分指出，作者提出的方法以自动方式生成大规模带标签的NER数据集，标注过程不涉及人工劳动，而是利用Wikipedia和DBpedia中的结构化数据检测实体提及。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-316cc9c43fddce56987ca066"}]}, {"key": "weakly_supervised_silver", "text": "所得数据集（SESAME）被描述为大规模弱监督数据集，即银标准语料库，使用它训练预测器被称为远程学习/弱监督学习。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-316cc9c43fddce56987ca066"}]}, {"key": "auxiliary_predictor", "text": "与某些先前方法的主要区别在于，该方法使用辅助NER预测器来捕获遗漏的实体，从而获得更密集的标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d22-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d22-t2", "session_id": "d22", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "automatic_generation_method", "text": "论文提出一种方法，利用DBpedia和Wikipedia中的链接与结构化数据，从公共数据源自动生成用于NER的带标签数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"}]}, {"key": "no_human_labeling", "text": "作者称该方法以自动方式生成大规模带标签NER数据集，标注过程不涉及人工劳动，而是利用Wikipedia和DBpedia中的结构化数据检测文章中实体提及。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-316cc9c43fddce56987ca066"}]}, {"key": "silver_standard_distant_learning", "text": "该工作被描述为构建大规模弱监督数据集（即银标准语料库），用此类数据集训练预测器通常称为distant learning。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}]}, {"key": "auxiliary_ner_denser_annotations", "text": "与BIBREF2等方法的主要区别在于，作者使用一个辅助NER预测器来捕获缺失的实体，从而产生更密集的标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}]}, {"key": "sesame_scale", "text": "由于DBpedia和Wikipedia数据源规模庞大，所得数据集SESAME由数百万条带标签句子组成。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"}]}, {"key": "portuguese_dataset", "text": "SESAME是针对葡萄牙语的NER数据集，通过在葡萄牙语Wikipedia和DBpedia上应用所述方法生成。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-002d0659794b118dc27438e1"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-bc9871d99593140a2d7ec03b"}]}, {"key": "entity_classes", "text": "论文中考虑的实体类别为人物、组织或地点三类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-2935cc19547d74dfb2f055bd"}]}, {"key": "sentence_filtering", "text": "构建SESAME时只考虑含有已标注实体的句子，因为仅有解析器抽取实体的句子无法利用DBpedia数据构建中投入的人工辨识。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-bc9871d99593140a2d7ec03b"}]}, {"key": "baseline_improves_ner", "text": "作者设计了一个神经网络基线，实验表明该数据集有助于构建更好的NER预测器。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-04f1fdda9b30597feeeefad5"}]}, {"key": "competitive_or_complementary", "text": "实验表明SESAME可用于训练有竞争力的NER预测器，或在与金标准数据一起使用时提升NER模型性能。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-316cc9c43fddce56987ca066"}]}, {"key": "language_generality", "text": "虽然SESAME是葡萄牙语数据集，但作者称其底层方法可应用于Wikipedia覆盖的几乎任何语言。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05758", "chunk_id": "c-316cc9c43fddce56987ca066"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d22-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
